ambda }_{1}=0$ and ${\\lambda }_{2}=-4,$ find the principal axes of the curve." :question/worked-solution "Notice that $A$ is symmetric. \nThe principal axes of the curve \n\n$$\n{x}^{T}\\,Ax=7\n$$\n\nare the vectors that give an orthonormal eigenvector basis for $A.$ Let's now find these eigenvectors.\n\n- For ${\\lambda }_{1}=0,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-0I & =[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{aligned}]-0[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSeeking a non-zero solution of $(A-0I)x=0$ gives the eigenvector ${v}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].$ Dividing ${v}_{1}$ by its norm $‖{v}_{1}‖=\\sqrt{2},$ we get \n\n$$\n\\frac{{v}_{1}}{‖{v}_{1}‖}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\n- For ${\\lambda }_{2}=-4,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-(-4)I & =[\\begin{aligned}-2 & 2 \\\\ 2 & -2\\end{aligned}]+4[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}2 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 2\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSeeking a non-zero solution of $(A-I)x=0$ gives the eigenvector ${v}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].$ Dividing ${v}_{2}$ by its norm $‖{v}_{2}‖=\\sqrt{2},$ we get \n\n$$\n\\frac{{v}_{2}}{‖{v}_{2}‖}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, the principal axes of our curve are\n\n$\\,$ $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\\,$ and $\\,\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}].$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-97995/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "e97b8e36-3790-5cdc-bd77-417574af23f3"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-97995"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-97993/selection/dd014a54a31ca9d13568839730417188e63ee5b7a10d7a5186ea5d51386b5ab4" :answer/id #uuid "6e0abc6c-4803-5352-939f-8825d5da4cc0" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\\,$ and $\\,\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{10}}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97993/selection/7d34d2935917069f38103b8c8bc59cdf07117bf5b0dda9669bb7a0ac36d96f59" :answer/id #uuid "d1cdf82f-3652-5af6-b2f6-cab5aabb90e1" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\frac{1}{5}[\\begin{aligned}4 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]\\,$ and $\\,\\frac{1}{5}[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 4\\end{aligned}]$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97993/selection/77fcaaea1c4af74cd08944a0d287578224a8fff4d1a654ee79e7094caa0a7c0b" :answer/id #uuid "28c7b2c2-3c6c-5410-a33c-a17dced950e1" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{5}}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]\\,$ and $\\,\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97993/selection/0b00657959d0824d7ff8a51658dfecbd28bac06717646f24cc42c9f9835787bc" :answer/id #uuid "28e81aa0-9b57-5da1-a08d-47aa658d82bc" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{13}}[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]\\,$ and $\\,\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{13}}[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97993/selection/2c8dd2717b4b539cf3fd995c4237442e1fcd1094d45c8172682cf61c8e4e46de" :answer/id #uuid "53ed1257-38a4-5302-b106-f9e63e7370fc" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]\\,$ and $\\,\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}[\\begin{aligned}-1 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-97993/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "8dfa6d41-4cec-5f13-bf87-8b546dd46cd1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-97993/selection/dd014a54a31ca9d13568839730417188e63ee5b7a10d7a5186ea5d51386b5ab4" :answer-field/choices ["q-97993/selection/dd014a54a31ca9d13568839730417188e63ee5b7a10d7a